=2 Walkthrough
* Get your mission from {n:Rasdinice}.
* Go to a Campaign stronghold in a northern zone under beastmen control and examine one of the two **???**s.
** Strongholds are {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} (I-8) and {z:Xarcabard (S)} (H-8).
